# Public resolvers, used as the default DNS on both sides.
#
# The NPU runs without systemd-resolved and lets dhcpcd write /etc/resolv.conf;
# this file is prepended to whatever the lease provides, so these two are tried
# first and the DHCP servers stay as fallbacks.  Override per site by editing it
# (or delete it to go back to DHCP-only).
nameserver 1.1.1.1
nameserver 8.8.8.8
